  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "16 ounce shrimp (peeled and deveined)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "4 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "1/4 cup chicken broth",
    "1/4 cup butter",
    "2 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "16 ounce zucchini (spiralized or sliced into noodles)",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1/4 cup fresh parsley (chopped)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients. Place the zucchini noodles in a colander over the sink and toss with salt. Let the noodles sit for 15-20 minutes, allowing them to drain excess water.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Keto-Shrimp-Scampi-Zoodles-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the olive oil to a pan over medium-high heat. Once hot, add in the shrimp and season with salt and pepper. Saute for 2-3 minutes without flipping, then flip and saute for an additional 1-2 minutes on the other side. Remove shrimp, leaving as much remaining oil in the pan as you can, and set aside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Keto-Shrimp-Scampi-Zoodles-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same pan, add the olive oil for the sauce, add in the minced garlic, then saute for 1-2 minutes until browned.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Keto-Shrimp-Scampi-Zoodles-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once fragrant, add in the chicken broth and deglaze the pan. Simmer for 2-3 minutes or until the broth has reduced by half. Once reduced, add in the butter and lemon juice for the sauce. Simmer for a few more minutes until the sauce comes together, then taste and season with salt and pepper if required.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Keto-Shrimp-Scampi-Zoodles-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Give the zucchini noodles a light squeeze to drain any remaining liquid from them. Add into the pan and cook for 2-3 minutes or until hot.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Keto-Shrimp-Scampi-Zoodles-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lastly, add the shrimp back into the pan to warm up. Add in chopped parsley if desired.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Keto-Shrimp-Scampi-Zoodles-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately. Drizzle a small amount of olive oil over the dish. Enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-shrimp-scampi-zoodles/#wprm-recipe-54961-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
